{"term": {"label": "義", "occurrences": 7, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-i", "title": "公孫丑上", "description": "公孫丑問曰：「夫子當路於齊，管仲、晏子之功，可復許乎？」\n孟子曰：「子誠齊人也，知管仲、晏子而已矣。或問乎曾西曰：『吾子與子路孰賢？』曾西蹴然曰：『吾先子之所畏也。』曰：『然則吾子與管仲孰賢？』曾西艴然不悅，曰：『爾何曾比予於管仲？管仲得君，如彼其專也；行乎國政，如彼其久也；功烈，如彼其卑也。爾何曾比予於是？』」曰：「"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "一", "id": "一"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "四", "id": "四"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "氣", "id": "氣"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "端", "id": "端"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聖", "id": "聖"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "足", "id": "足"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.3609765531356006, "source": "道", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 0.5877866649021191, "source": "道", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.3609765531356006, "source": "道", "target": "氣"}, {"weight": 2.0541237336955462, "source": "道", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.2068258733083426, "source": "道", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 0.4054651081081644, "source": "心", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 0.4054651081081644, "source": "心", "target": "生"}, {"weight": 0.8622235106038793, "source": "心", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.8109302162163288, "source": "心", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 1.6376087894007967, "source": "心", "target": "端"}, {"weight": 0.4054651081081644, "source": "心", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.8109302162163288, "source": "心", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 1.0245043165143877, "source": "知", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.4299694246225523, "source": "知", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 0.5136786927483972, "source": "知", "target": "聖"}, {"weight": 1.2068258733083426, "source": "知", "target": "足"}, {"weight": 1.4299694246225523, "source": "知", "target": "四"}, {"weight": 0.8703536366871296, "source": "知", "target": "端"}, {"weight": 1.0245043165143877, "source": "端", "targe